    "title": "Trade audit time synchronization must be explicit",
    "statement": "交易事件、行情事件、订单状态、成交、风控动作、模型推理和 RAG/MCP 审计日志必须声明 clock source、sync status、timestamp precision、timezone、drift policy 和 ordering caveat；没有可信时间同步证据时，只能标记 ordering_unknown，不得推导执行质量、合规结论或交易许可。",
    "normalized_claim": "phase53.trade_audit_time_synchronization_required.v1",
    "evidence_summary": "FINRA Rule 6820 supports business clock synchronization, NIST atomic clock reference, drift, and daily synchronization requirements. / RTS 25 supports UTC time reference and timestamp accuracy requirements for trading venues and members. / CAT clock synchronization guidance supports certification and clock sync requirements for CAT reporting.",
